      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think I agree with this one.\n\nThe `Extensions` struct is (or should be) a list of extensions (or capabilities) that are available and should be used. We are told if `VK_KHR_zero_initialize_workgroup_memory` is available, or the Vulkan Memory Model is available, or if the `DotProductInput4x8Bit` capability is enabled etc. This is just like that IMO. So Dawn should just tell us whether `StorageInputOutput16` is available, and we use that information to determine whether or not a polyfill is needd.",
      "revId": "e8d39e0f2e0354b788bd4130fa9b2c153cdeb137",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
